Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," as if you had rolled the maximum on the die.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Krath Illusions"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Illusion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Illusion"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", you can reduce the penalty for large ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Illusions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Illusions"}]}," by one half (rounded down, minimum -1).\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Krath Intuition"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You have a natural ability to use Dark Side artifacts, such as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Talismans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Talismans"}," and alchemical items. Once per encounter, you may spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to treat the damage from a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Alchemical Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Alchemical_Weapon"}," as though you had rolled the maximum damage on the dice.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Krath Surge"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, using rudimentary Sith sorcery, you channel ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side"}," energy in a manner that boosts one use of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"},". As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", you can add 1 die of damage (if the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," deals damage) or extend the range of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," by 6 squares (if it has a range beyond yourself or a single target). Using this Talent automatically adds the [",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side"}]},"] descriptor to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," used.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
